(The Time Traveller \(for so it will be convenient to speak of him\) was expounding a) Tj
T*
(recondite matter to us. His grey eyes shone and twinkled, and his usually pale face was) Tj
T*
(flushed and animated. The fire burnt brightly, and the soft radiance of the incandescent) Tj
T*
(lights in the lilies of silver caught the bubbles that flashed and passed in our glasses.) Tj
T*
(Our chairs, being his patents, embraced and caressed us rather than submitted to be sat) Tj
T*
(upon, and there was that luxurious after-dinner atmosphere, when thought runs gracefully) Tj
T*
(free of the trammels of precision. And he put it to us in this way--marking the points) Tj
T*
(with a lean forefinger--as we sat and lazily admired his earnestness over this new) Tj
T*
(paradox \(as we thought it\) and his fecundity.) Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10.5 Tf
