15.500 TL
("You must follow me carefully. I shall have to controvert one or two ideas that are) Tj
T*
(almost universally accepted. The geometry, for instance, they taught you at school is) Tj
T*
(founded on a misconception.") Tj
ET
BT
/F1 10.5 Tf
0.043 0.051 0.075 rg
1 0 0 1 64 430.39 Tm
15.500 TL
