("That day, too, I made a friend--of a sort. It happened that, as I was watching some of) Tj
T*
(the little people bathing in a shallow, one of them was seized with cramp and began) Tj
T*
(drifting downstream. The main current ran rather swiftly, but not too strongly for even a) Tj
T*
(moderate swimmer. It will give you an idea, therefore, of the strange deficiency in these) Tj
T*
(creatures, when I tell you that none made the slightest attempt to rescue the weakly) Tj
T*
(crying little thing which was drowning before their eyes. When I realised this, I) Tj
T*
(hurriedly slipped off my clothes, and, wading in at a point lower down, I caught the poor) Tj
T*
(mite and drew her safe to land. A little rubbing of the limbs soon brought her round, and) Tj
T*
(I had the satisfaction of seeing she was all right before I left her. I had got to such a) Tj
T*
(low estimate of her kind that I did not expect any gratitude from her. In that, however,) Tj
T*
(I was wrong.) Tj
