("This happened in the morning. In the afternoon I met my little woman, as I believe it) Tj
T*
(was, as I was returning towards my centre from an exploration, and she received me with) Tj
T*
(cries of delight and presented me with a big garland of flowers--evidently made for me) Tj
T*
(and me alone. The thing took my imagination. Very possibly I had been feeling desolate.) Tj
T*
