T*
(together in a little stone arbour, engaged in conversation, chiefly of smiles. The) Tj
T*
(creature's friendliness affected me exactly as a child's might have done. We passed each) Tj
T*
(other flowers, and she kissed my hands. I did the same to hers. Then I tried talk, and) Tj
T*
(found that her name was Weena, which, though I don't know what it meant, somehow seemed) Tj
T*
(appropriate enough. That was the beginning of a queer friendship which lasted a week, and) Tj
T*
(ended--as I will tell you!) Tj
