("She was exactly like a child. She wanted to be with me always. She tried to follow me) Tj
T*
(everywhere, and on my next journey out and about it went to my heart to tire her down,) Tj
T*
(and leave her at last, exhausted and calling after me rather plaintively. But the) Tj
T*
(problems of the world had to be mastered. I had not, I said to myself, come into the) Tj
